        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "The Productivity and Business Processes segment consists of productivity, communication, and information services spanning a variety of devices and platforms, including Microsoft 365 Commercial and Consumer products, LinkedIn, and Dynamics.",
