          "chunk_id": "MSFT-000119312526323660-0011",
          "quote": "Our Productivity and Business Processes segment consists of products and services in our portfolio of productivity, communication, and information services, spanning a variety of devices and platforms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Azure's competitive advantage includes enabling a hybrid cloud and the ability to run at a scale that meets the needs of businesses of all sizes and complexities.",
