          "chunk_id": "MSFT-000119312526323660-0019",
          "quote": "Azure's competitive advantage includes enabling a hybrid cloud, allowing deployment of existing datacenters with our public cloud into a single, cohesive infrastructure, and the ability to run at a scale"
