      "text": "Revenue grew from {{m:revenue:FY-2}} in {{p:FY-2}} to {{m:revenue:FY0}} in {{p:FY0}} and reached {{m:revenue:LTM}} over the {{p:LTM}} period.",
      "citations": []
    },
