      "text": "As of {{p:FY0}}, scheduled long-term debt maturities are {{m:maturity_year_1:FY0}} in the next twelve months, {{m:maturity_year_2:FY0}} in year two, {{m:maturity_year_3:FY0}} in year three, {{m:maturity_year_4:FY0}} in year four, {{m:maturity_year_5:FY0}} in year five, and {{m:maturity_after_year_5:FY0}} thereafter.",
      "citations": []
    },
