      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "As of {{p:FY0}}, debt maturing within 24 months totals {{m:debt_due_24m:FY0}}, equal to {{m:share_due_24m:FY0}} of total debt of {{m:total_debt:FY0}}, and near-term maturity cover is {{m:near_term_maturity_cover:FY0}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Management expects existing cash, cash equivalents, short-term investments, cash flows from operations, and access to capital markets to be sufficient to fund debt maturities for at least the next 12 months and thereafter.",
