    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "As of {{p:FY0}}, long-term debt consists of senior unsecured obligations that rank equally with Microsoft's other outstanding obligations, and interest is paid semi-annually except for euro-denominated debt, which is paid annually.",
