          "chunk_id": "MSFT-000119312526323660-0220",
          "quote": "Debt in the table above is comprised of senior unsecured obligations and ranks equally with our other outstanding obligations. Interest is paid semi-annually, except for the Euro-denominated debt"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Cash used in financing increased primarily due to a $4.9 billion increase in cash used for repayments of debt.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "MSFT-000119312526436133-0075",
          "quote": "a $4.9 billion increase in cash used for repayments of debt"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Proceeds from debt issuances may be used for general corporate purposes, including repayment of existing debt.",
